.TH diff 1  "diff " 
.SH NAME
diff \- Compare the working tree\*(Aqs architecture against `git_ref` (directive §17) — did this change increase concentration? Informational: always exits 0 on a successful run, regardless of what it finds. Requires `path` to be a git repository
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdiff\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIGIT_REF\fR> [\fIPATH\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Compare the working tree\*(Aqs architecture against `git_ref` (directive §17) — did this change increase concentration? Informational: always exits 0 on a successful run, regardless of what it finds. Requires `path` to be a git repository
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIGIT_REF\fR>

.TP
[\fIPATH\fR] [default: .]

